            <p>Staples is an office and technology retailer that has kept businesses and consumers outfitted in supplies and services since 1986. With over one thousand locations in the United States and a well-stocked online store, you’ll never have to worry about where you’ll get your next ink cartridge or ream of paper. The Staples virtual store allows you to enhance your home or office on a budget, thanks to their robust selection of in-store discounts, online deals and everyday low prices. These prices are slashed even lower when you come prepared with all of the latest printable promo codes and in-store coupons. Coupon code collecting is crucial for a business-minded individual, and doing so means that you’ll never have to pay full price at Staples again.</p>

