                      <div class="discountTips scrollable">
              <div class="head"><h3>Staples Discount Tips</h3></div>
              <div class="seoBlock">
                <p>Staples gives you plenty of ways to save on both individual items and whole departments Thanks to these in-store promo codes, online coupons and discount codes. Paper and ink coupons are common, as are coupons for furniture and other basic office supplies. Plus, you can use multiple coupon codes on a single order thanks to Staples&rsquo; friendly stackable coupons policy. In addition to coupon opportunities, Staples has no shortage of special programs and customer resources that can help you save even more.</p>
<p><strong>Become a Member for Perks&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p>Staples Plus is a paid program for small businesses. It costs $49 per year and includes the following perks:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>Free delivery on eligible orders</p></li>
<li><p>Discounts on paper</p></li>
<li><p>10% cashback on ink and toner orders</p></li>
<li><p>$2 back for every recycled ink cartridge</p></li>
<li><p>Customized deals on your favorite products</p></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Get Staples Premium Membership</strong></p>
<p>To ramp up the perks, apply for their premium-level membership. Designed for mid-to-large businesses, the benefits include:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>Free delivery on eligible purchases</p></li>
<li><p>3% back on qualifying orders above $250</p></li>
<li><p>Exclusive discounts on specific products</p></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Save More</strong></p>
<p>To keep even more cash in your wallet, stay alert for all the company's promotions:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>Browse their Coupon Corner for Staples coupons</p></li>
<li><p>Visit the My Deals and Weekly Ad pages for Staples discounts&nbsp;</p></li>
<li><p>Follow them on Facebook or Twitter for perks and offers</p></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>How to Use a Staples Coupon</strong></p>
<p>When you begin the checkout process, enter your Staples account information or check out as a guest. Beneath your order summary, there will be a link labeled &ldquo;Add Coupon.&rdquo; Click on the link and enter your Staples promo code in the pop-up box. Click &ldquo;Apply&rdquo; and then &ldquo;Done.&rdquo; With in-store printable coupons, you can get your in-store deals as soon as you show your coupon(s) to the cashier.&nbsp;</p>
<p>If you need to enter more than one online promo code, simply repeat the process until you have entered all of your coupons. Note that you can only use one transaction coupon at a time, but you can use as many product coupons as you want, as long as you have met the purchasing requirements. Additionally, it&rsquo;s important to know that coupons are not applicable toward computers, laptops or tablets.</p>
<p><strong>Shop Deals and Sales&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p>If you want to stay on top of the latest Staples online discounts, visit the <a target="_blank" href="/?u2=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.staples.com%2Fdeals%2FStaples-Daily-Deals%2FSEGDD0000001">Daily Deals</a> page. Deals are organized into categories based on type of item and brand. If you're logged into your Staples account, this page will show online deals that you are likely to enjoy based on your browsing and purchase history.</p>
<p><strong>Sign Up for Staples Email Offers&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p>Stay informed on all of the latest Staples promos and holiday sales by signing up for their email program. This is especially useful for business owners, as they send helpful articles and insights to subscribers in addition to coupons and sale information. You can sign up at the bottom of the homepage.</p>
<p><strong>Staples Rewards Program&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p>The <a target="_blank" href="/?u2=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.staples.com%2Fsbd%2Fcre%2Fprograms%2Frewards%2Flearn-more%2Findex.html%3FTYPE%3D33554433%26REALMOID%3D06-00000a28-8123-1a59-b2c1-11140a0ca01e%26SMAUTHREASON%3D0%26METHOD%3DGET%26SMAGENTNAME%3D-SM-staples%252ecom--nginx%26TARGET%3D-SM-https%253a%252f%252fwww%252estaples%252ecom%252frewards">Staples Rewards</a> program offers up to 5% back in rewards on everything you buy, plus free shipping offers and $2 back each time you recycle your old printer ink cartridges. If you spend between $0 and $999 in one year, you get 2% back in rewards, bonus events and ink and toner recycling rewards. If you spend over $1,000 in a year, you get 5% back in rewards, as well as a higher ink and toner recycling limit, $25 print and marketing services and $20 off tech services. Joining this loyalty program is free and it only takes a moment to sign up.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p>Since Staples doesn't offer status-based discounts like a military discount, senior citizen discount or student discount, joining Staples Rewards is the most effective way to save a little bit every time you shop there.</p>
<p><strong>Get Cash Back at the Staples Rebate Center</strong></p>
<p>Some Staples purchases may come with a cash back rebate, and it might not always be easy to tell when you're shopping online or in-store. Visit the <a target="_blank" href="/?u2=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.staples.com%2Fsbd%2Fcre%2Fmarketing%2Feasybutton%2Frebates.html%3Fcm_sp%3Dcreative-_-easy%2520button_worklk05-_-rebates">Staples Rebate Cente</a>r to see if any of your recent or upcoming purchases qualify. You can track the status of your rebate on this site as well.</p>
<p><strong>Sign Up for the Staples More Account Credit Card</strong></p>
<p>If you spend a lot of money at Staples on a regular basis or want to finance a major purchase, it's worth seeing if you qualify for a <a target="_blank" href="/?u2=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.staples.com%2Fsbd%2Fcre%2Fprograms%2Fcredit%2F%23business">Staples More Account</a>. A Staples More Personal Account allows you to carry a credit balance and finance large purchases with no interest. If you are a business or a nonprofit, you may be better suited for a Staples More Commercial Account or Business Account. All accounts receive 5% back in rewards on every purchase (and an automatic upgrade to the Premier rewards tier) as well as free shipping.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Staples Return Policy&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p>If you need to return or exchange your recent Staples purchase, the rules and limitations vary depending on the type of item(s) you want to return. Office supplies, unopened software and unopened ink and toner can be returned at any time with a valid receipt. Technology and furniture must be returned within 14 days of purchase. Digital software and prepaid cards can't be returned.</p>
<p><strong>Staples Price Adjustment Policy&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p>Take advantage of Staples Price Match Guarantee, which goes beyond basic price matching by offering you 10% off the difference when you show proof of a lower price on an identical item. If you find the item for a lower price within 14 days of your purchase, just let them know and Staples will refund the difference. You can only price match in-store, and there are <a target="_blank" href="/?u2=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.staples.com%2Fsbd%2Fcre%2Fmarketing%2Fpmg%2Findex.html">a few things</a> that are not eligible for a price adjustment.</p>
<p><strong>Get the Best Shipping Price</strong></p>
<p>Get free shipping by spending at least $49.99 online. You can also get free shipping just by adding ink, toner or case paper to your order. Rewards members and Staples More Account card holders are eligible for free shipping without a minimum.</p>
<p><strong>Contact Staples Customer Service</strong></p>
<p>If you have any questions about your recent Staples purchase, the Staples More Account, gift cards or any other office-supply related inquiries, there are plenty of ways to get in touch with their customer service team. You can reach the Staples customer service phone number by dialing 1-(800)-333-3330. For live chat, email, FAQs and other forms of contact, visit their <a target="_blank" href="/?u2=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.staples.com%2Fhc">Contact Us</a> page for more information.</p>
<p><strong>Staples Company Information&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p><i>Corporate Headquarters Address:</i> 500 Staples Dr., Framingham, MA 01702</p>
